## Quick Example

```erb
<%%= render LightningUiKit::InputComponent.new(
  form: form,
  attribute: :email,
  type: :email,
  label: "Email address",
  placeholder: "you@example.com"
) %>

<%%= render LightningUiKit::ButtonComponent.new(type: :submit) do %>
  Save changes
<%% end %>
```

